//   F3  report     /example-report draws real charts: the trend as lines, the channels as a donut, the funnel, the hours, the open cases
//   1   brand      "NuovaSolution" everywhere (no short "Nuova"), the brand palette (black, white, one accent), the close in brand colours
//   2   hero       the owner's subline, the three chips without "en español", the brand moment on load
//   3   demo       the human reply, no ticks, times on both sides, the small assistant mark
//   4   flow       the drawn path with arrows, the logo in the middle, no grey line, the corrected wording
//   5   functions  eight scenes with progress 01–08, the active card lifted, the stage clickable, listing photos, the Daily view on "Tomar"
//   6   scenes     social posting, labels + origin, language on the record, follow-up with permission, each with its honest state
//   7   status     every state word from lib/claims.ts: "Incluido" clear, "Próximamente" quiet
//   8   report     five channels with quiet marks, three insights, "Datos de ejemplo"
//   9   3d         02 = the ground floor turning, the path in three steps, the status from claims
//   10  plans      no "Recomendado", Growth highlighted without "más completo", nothing under 14 px in the table, the icons
